title: hsds-proportions
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Alapati
    given-names: Susanth
repository-code: "https://github.com/S-Alapati/hsds-proportions"
abstract: >-
  Assigns Oxford Nanopore reads to hsdS alleles of a Type I
  restriction-modification shufflon using the 6mA recognition motifs each
  allele leaves, and reports the proportion of the population carrying each.
keywords:
  - nanopore
  - methylation
  - phase variation
  - restriction-modification
